The  utility  sets or reports on terminal characteristics for the
device that is its standard input.  If no options or operands are
specified, it reports the settings of a subset of characteristics
as well as additional ones if they differ from their default val‐
ues.  Otherwise it modifies the terminal state according  to  the
specified arguments.  Some combinations of arguments are mutually
exclusive  on  some  terminal  types.   The following options are
available: Display all the current settings for the  terminal  to
standard  output  as per Display all the current settings for the
terminal to standard output in the traditional and formats.  Open
and use the terminal named by rather than using  standard  input.
